DATA LICENSE NOTICE:

The original survey microdata (CHFS, CFPS, CHIP, CLDS) are NOT included and are
subject to their respective data use agreements:

- CHFS (China Household Finance Survey): Contact chfsdata@swufe.edu.cn
- CFPS (China Family Panel Studies): Contact cfps@pku.edu.cn
- CHIP (Chinese Household Income Project): Contact chip@bnu.edu.cn
- CLDS (China Labor-force Dynamics Survey): Contact clds@sysu.edu.cn

Users must obtain data access independently and comply with all data use restrictions.
The included province-policy workbooks are compilations of public policy information;
their source URLs are recorded in the workbooks. Included result files contain only
aggregate, non-identifying statistics.

MODEL WEIGHTS NOTICE:

Trained model weights are NOT released due to:
1. Potential memorization of sensitive survey data
2. Data use agreement restrictions prohibiting derivative distribution
3. The controlled-access status of the underlying survey records

The included code and recorded parameters support reproduction after users obtain
the controlled-access data, required model access, APIs, and compatible hardware.
